{"content_hash": "26353762650d5f9d", "version_id": 802, "article_id": 81, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Farming Simulator 25 adds coffee and alpacas in new DLC", "title_zh": "《模拟农场25》新DLC上线：种咖啡、养羊驼", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221607", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612287230202-1ff1d85d1bdf?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZGxjJTIwdmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY29udHJvbGxlcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzMjM2MjEzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Javier Martínez on Unsplash", "author": "Javier Martínez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cjdante?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/game-controller-in-neon-light-hUD0PUczwJQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "5ab094f0a0ba"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-29", "word_count": 145, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Sega has released a new paid DLC for Farming Simulator 25. It is called Beans & Alpacas. Players can now run a farm in South America.", "lead_zh": "世嘉为《模拟农场25》推出了一款新的付费DLC，名叫“Beans & Alpacas”。玩家现在可以在南美洲经营农场了。", "preview": "The new DLC adds a farm area called Catuaí. It is based on Brazil. The area has red soil, green hills and small rivers. Players can grow cof", "preview_zh": "这款新DLC加入了一个叫卡杜艾的农场区域，灵感来自巴西。这里有红土、绿色山丘和小河。玩家可以种咖啡和香蕉，还能做提拉米苏和香蕉片。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 786, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 49.7, "size_bytes": 299088, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@b5015e3/content/data/versions/802.json", "paragraphs": ["The new DLC adds a farm area called Catuaí. It is based on Brazil. The area has red soil, green hills and small rivers. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also make tiramisu and banana chips.", "Players can keep alpacas and Brahman cows. They can walk with the alpacas to make them happy. Once a year, they can cut the alpaca wool. They can sell the wool or make socks, pillows and toys.", "The DLC also brings more than 25 new machines. These come from brands like John Deere and New Holland. Two brands, Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders, join the series for the first time.", "The game is on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac. You can buy the DLC alone or in the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is also on sale."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款新DLC加入了一个叫卡杜艾的农场区域，灵感来自巴西。这里有红土、绿色山丘和小河。玩家可以种咖啡和香蕉，还能做提拉米苏和香蕉片。", "玩家可以养羊驼和婆罗门牛。带羊驼散步能让它们更开心。每年可以剪一次羊驼毛，毛可以直接卖，也能做成袜子、枕头和玩具。", "这个DLC还带来25种以上的新农机，来自John Deere、New Holland等品牌。Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders这两个品牌是第一次加入这个系列。", "游戏登陆PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC和Mac平台。DLC可以单独买，也包含在第二年季票里。含正篇的特别版也已开卖。"], "body": "The new DLC adds a farm area called Catuaí. It is based on Brazil. The area has red soil, green hills and small rivers. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also make tiramisu and banana chips.\n\nPlayers can keep alpacas and Brahman cows. They can walk with the alpacas to make them happy. Once a year, they can cut the alpaca wool. They can sell the wool or make socks, pillows and toys.\n\nThe DLC also brings more than 25 new machines. These come from brands like John Deere and New Holland. Two brands, Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders, join the series for the first time.\n\nThe game is on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac. You can buy the DLC alone or in the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is also on sale.", "body_zh": "这款新DLC加入了一个叫卡杜艾的农场区域，灵感来自巴西。这里有红土、绿色山丘和小河。玩家可以种咖啡和香蕉，还能做提拉米苏和香蕉片。\n\n玩家可以养羊驼和婆罗门牛。带羊驼散步能让它们更开心。每年可以剪一次羊驼毛，毛可以直接卖，也能做成袜子、枕头和玩具。\n\n这个DLC还带来25种以上的新农机，来自John Deere、New Holland等品牌。Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders这两个品牌是第一次加入这个系列。\n\n游戏登陆PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC和Mac平台。DLC可以单独买，也包含在第二年季票里。含正篇的特别版也已开卖。", "text": "The new DLC adds a farm area called Catuaí. It is based on Brazil. The area has red soil, green hills and small rivers. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also make tiramisu and banana chips. Players can keep alpacas and Brahman cows. They can walk with the alpacas to make them happy. Once a year, they can cut the alpaca wool. They can sell the wool or make socks, pillows and toys. The DLC also brings more than 25 new machines. These come from brands like John Deere and New Holland. Two brands, Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders, join the series for the first time. The game is on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac. You can buy the DLC alone or in the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is also on sale.", "vocab": [{"word": "DLC", "pos": "noun", "zh": "追加下载内容", "note": "游戏术语，指付费或免费的新内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "farm", "pos": "noun", "zh": "农场", "note": "也可作动词，表示务农", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "grow", "pos": "verb", "zh": "种植；生长", "note": "grow coffee 种咖啡", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "keep", "pos": "verb", "zh": "饲养；保持", "note": "keep animals 养动物", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wool", "pos": "noun", "zh": "羊毛", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "machine", "pos": "noun", "zh": "机器；农机", "note": "复数 machines", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "brand", "pos": "noun", "zh": "品牌", "note": "常见于商品介绍", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "on sale", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "开卖；出售", "note": "也可表示打折", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:10.588590", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350